   "end": 8.17,
   "text": "Put viewings, meetings and calls on the calendar and tick off your tasks as you go.",
   "step": 0,
   "url": "",
   "intro": true
  },
  {
   "start": 8.17,
   "end": 14.17,
   "text": "The calendar shows the viewings, meetings, calls and tasks of the whole leasing team.",
   "step": 1,
   "url": "/admin/calendar"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.17,
   "end": 19.96,
   "text": "Today is highlighted. Each entry is coloured by type and opens its lead.",
   "step": 2,
   "url": "/admin/calendar"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.96,
   "end": 24.17,
   "text": "Move between months, or show only your own entries.",
   "step": 3,
   "url": "/admin/calendar"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.17,
   "end": 28.36,
   "text": "To book a viewing, use Schedule. Choose Viewing.",
   "step": 4,
   "url": "/admin/calendar"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.36,
   "end": 33.69,
   "text": "Choose the lead, so the viewing appears on its timeline too.",
   "step": 5,
   "url": "/admin/calendar"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.69,
   "end": 37.81,
   "text": "Give it a clear title.",
   "step": 6,
   "url": "/admin/calendar"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.81,
   "end": 42.42,
   "text": "Set the day and time, and who will host it.",
   "step": 7,
   "url": "/admin/calendar"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.02,
   "end": 51.81,
   "text": "Add it. The office opens the lead, with the viewing waiting on its timeline.",
